# Alpine v3.23 packages that the virgl check of the Linux test guest unpacks
# (graphics.md §12 step 1, #022). Each name is a prebuilt test-linux component of
# ThirdParty/ThirdParty.lock.json. v3.23 is the newest Alpine release whose Mesa is built with
# the virgl Gallium driver for aarch64; v3.24 dropped it. The closure is what apk resolves
# for kmscube and Mesa's EGL, GBM, GLES, GL, and DRI packages, and libdrm. musl is not listed:
# the pinned minirootfs has musl 1.2.6-r2, newer than the v3.23 musl 1.2.5.
# scripts/fetch-test-linux.sh downloads them, and scripts/build-test-initramfs.sh unpacks them
# in this order and checks them with scripts/tools/initramfs-manifest.py.
alpine-hwdata-pci
alpine-kmscube
alpine-libbsd
alpine-libdrm
alpine-libelf
alpine-libexpat
alpine-libffi
alpine-libgcc
alpine-libmd
alpine-libpciaccess
alpine-libpng
alpine-libstdcxx
alpine-libx11
alpine-libxau
alpine-libxcb
alpine-libxdmcp
alpine-libxext
alpine-libxml2
alpine-libxshmfence
alpine-libxxf86vm
alpine-llvm21-libs
alpine-mesa
alpine-mesa-dri-gallium
alpine-mesa-egl
alpine-mesa-gbm
alpine-mesa-gl
alpine-mesa-gles
alpine-spirv-tools
alpine-wayland-libs-client
alpine-xz-libs
alpine-zlib
alpine-zstd-libs
